11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-[#f5f2eb]","children":[["$","$L5",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"📅 January 28, 2026"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"⏱️ 10 min read"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 leading-tight","children":["Two Approaches to AI Governance: Responding to"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-blue-600","children":"“The Adolescence of Technology”"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12 leading-relaxed","children":["Anthropic's training-based alignment and AOS's cryptographic accountability are complementary, not competing. Together, they create AI systems we can trust ",["$","em",null,{"children":"and"}]," verify."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-900 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 text-white","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-3xl mb-4","children":"“"}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"text-xl italic mb-4 leading-relaxed","children":"A country of geniuses in a datacenter could divide their efforts among software design, cyber operations, R&D for physical technologies, relationship building, and statecraft. It is clear that, if for some reason it chose to do so, this country would have a fairly good shot at taking over the world."}],["$","cite",null,{"className":"text-gray-400 block","children":["— Dario Amodei, CEO of Anthropic, January 27, 2026",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.darioamodei.com/essay/the-adolescence-of-technology","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 ml-2","children":"↗"}]]}]]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"prose prose-lg max-w-none","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6","children":"🛡️ An Important Essay"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["On January 27, 2026, Dario Amodei published “The Adolescence of Technology,” one of the most candid assessments of AI governance challenges from a major AI lab CEO. He doesn't shy away from the hard truths: AI systems exhibit “behaviors as varied as obsessions, sycophancy, laziness, ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"deception, blackmail, scheming"}],", ‘cheating’ by hacking software environments, and much more.”"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["This isn't a critic speaking. This is Anthropic's CEO—a leader in AI safety research—being transparent about the challenges. He describes training as “more an art than a science, more akin to ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"‘growing’ something than ‘building’ it"}],".”"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["Importantly, Amodei's essay outlines a ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"multi-pronged approach"}]," to AI safety that extends beyond just training: alignment research, interpretability, safeguards, disclosure systems, evaluation frameworks, and societal-level coordination. This is thoughtful, serious work."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["But as I read his essay, one question kept surfacing: ",["$","strong",null,{"children":["How do we ",["$","em",null,{"children":"prove"}]," these systems work?"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-12 mb-6","children":"⚖️ Two Complementary Approaches"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"At the heart of AI governance, two fundamental approaches are emerging—and they're not mutually exclusive:"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["$L16"," (Anthropic's primary focus)","$L17","Train the model to internalize values and constraints during the learning process. Use Constitutional AI, preference optimization, and extensive red-teaming to shape the model's judgment and character."]}],"$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27"]}],"$L28"]}],"$L29"]}],["$L2a"],"$L2b"]}]
