1a:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"The AOS Constitutional Framework provides the accountability layer. Instead of relying solely on training to instill values, we use cryptographic verification to prove compliance. SHA-256 hashing, GPG signatures, blockchain timestamping—immutable evidence that actions match stated principles."}]
