20:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":["Think of it like driver's ed: we ",["$","em",null,{"children":"train"}]," people to drive safely, but we also require licenses, traffic laws, cameras, and legal accountability. AI systems deserve the same multi-layered approach."]}]
